        <div class="pl-collaborate__audiences tla-fade tla-d1">
          <ul class="pl-audience-list">
            <li class="pl-audience-item"><span class="pl-audience-dot"></span>A quote with VAT-inclusive final figures</li>
            <li class="pl-audience-item"><span class="pl-audience-dot"></span>Advice on size, based on the room and its light</li>
